OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer charged with sexual
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving police officer has been
OL,7,Fcharged with multiple sexual offences.
OL,9,FRhiryd Wyn Hughes, 65, of Wootton Hall,
OL,10,FNorthampton, has been charged with
OL,11,Fthree counts of indecent exposure and
OL,12,Fone count of misconduct in a public
OL,13,Foffice. The charges relate to incidents
OL,14,Fbetween 2018 and 2024.
OL,16,FWyn Hughes, a sergeant at
OL,17,FNorthamptonshire Police, had been
OL,18,Fworking in the force's Anti-Social
OL,19,FBehaviour team and was suspended from
OL,20,Fduty in June 2025 following the first
OL,21,Freport.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
